(527, '1', 'update', 'updated the page contents', 'updated the page contents of About Us from <section id=\"ij0e\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\"><div id=\"ioep\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"container\"><h2 id=\"ii8k\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\">Who We Are\r\n	</h2><p id=\"iee8\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\" spellcheck=\"false\" class=\"cke_editable cke_editable_inline cke_contents_ltr cke_show_borders\">Romance has a home. It’s called \r\n	  <b id=\"idjn\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\">PRECIOUSPAGESEBOOKSTORE\r\n	  </b>, and it’s all about us. If you are a sucker for romance, you’ll be at home with us. \r\n	  <b id=\"ighm5\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\">PRECIOUSPAGESEBOOKSTORE\r\n	  </b> is a digital platform that offers to readers all over the world the best digital Tagalog romance novel experience. We give you stories that make you feel the real essence of romance—and love. But then we are also more than romance. Watch for our alternative stories and novels via the digital distribution of special editions from these publishers: <b>Red Line Media Publishing, Inc. (Red Room), LIB Creatives (Pastrybug), Bookware Publishing, Inc. (My Special Valentine), Lampara Publishing House, Inc. + World’s Bestsellers (Filipino translations of the world’s current bestsellers and classics.)</b> To date, we have more than 10,000 active users, mostly from abroad—and the number is growing. With us, you can access our eBooks in ePub format, on either Apple or Android device, at an affordable price. Download the app reader now!\r\n	  <b id=\"i45j9\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\">PRECIOUS PAGES EBOOKSTORE\r\n	  </b> is owned and operated by \r\n	  <b id=\"ibcd3\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\">Precious Pages Corporation.\r\n	  </b></p><!--p id=\"i8t8\" data-gjs-type=\"paragraph\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"nobottommargin gjs-selected\">\"S