(600, '1', 'update', 'updated the article contents', 'updated the article contents of Well, well, well look who’s here… from <section id=\"iqqs\"><div class=\"container\" id=\"irvf\"><p id=\"ie2u\">&nbsp;( ≖‿ ≖ )</p><p id=\"ikkg\">In celebration of LIB&rsquo;s 10th anniversary, we bring you&hellip; *drumrolls* An author who has been with us since the beginning of LIB. One of our pioneer authors who crafted your beloved books ✨ C.C. ✨ See you at the PBF for the book signing! 🩵 #LIBTurns10 #PBF #ABeautifulAprilIn celebration of LIB&rsquo;s 10th anniversary, we bring you&hellip; *drumrolls* An author who has been with us since the beginning of LIB. One of our pioneer authors who crafted your beloved books ✨ C.C. ✨ See you at the PBF for the book signing! 🩵 #LIBTurns10 #PBF #ABeautifulApril</p></div></section> to In celebration of LIB’s 10th anniversary, we bring you… *drumrolls* \r\nAn author who has been with us since the beginning of LIB.\r\nOne of our pioneer authors who crafted your beloved books \r\n✨ C.C. ✨ \r\nSee you at the PBF for the book signing! 🩵\r\n#LIBTurns10\r\n#PBF\r\n#ABeautifulAprilIn celebration of LIB’s 10th anniversary, we bring you… *drumrolls* \r\nAn author who has been with us since the beginning of LIB.\r\nOne of our pioneer authors who crafted your beloved books \r\n✨ C.C. ✨ \r\nSee you at the PBF for the book signing! 🩵\r\n#LIBTurns10\r\n#PBF\r\n#ABeautifulApril', '2024-04-22 11:57:47', 'articles', '<section id=\"iqqs\"><div class=\"container\" id=\"irvf\"><p id=\"ie2u\">&nbsp;( ≖‿ ≖ )</p><p id=\"ikkg\">In celebration of LIB&rsquo;s 10th anniversary, we bring you&hellip; *drumrolls* An author who has been with us since the beginning of LIB. One of our pioneer authors who crafted your beloved books ✨ C.C. ✨ See you at the PBF for the book signing! 🩵 #LIBTurns10 #PBF #ABeautifulAprilIn celebration of LIB&rsquo;s 10th anniversary, we bring you&hellip; *drumrolls* An author who has been with us since the beginning of LIB. One of our pioneer authors who crafted your beloved books ✨ C.C. ✨ See you at the PBF for the book signing! 🩵 #LIBTurns10 #PBF #ABeautifulApril</p></div></section>', 'In celebration of LIB’s 10th anniversary, we bring you… *drumrolls* \r\nAn author who has been with us since the beginning of LIB.\r\nOne of our pioneer authors who crafted your beloved books \r\n✨ C.C. ✨ \r\nSee you at the PBF for the book signing! 🩵\r\n#LIBTurns10\r\n#PBF\r\n#ABeautifulAprilIn celebration of LIB’s 10th anniversary, we bring you… *drumrolls* \r\nAn author who has been with us since the beginning of LIB.\r\nOne of our pioneer authors who crafted your beloved books \r\n✨ C.C. ✨ \r\nSee you at the PBF for the book signing! 🩵\r\n#LIBTurns10\r\n#PBF\r\n#ABeautifulApril', '26'),
