are those of the respective author(s) or distributor(s) and not of PPC. In many instances, the content available represents the opinions and judgments of the respective content provider or user. PPC neither endorses nor is responsible for the accuracy or reliability of any opinion, advice or statement made on this service by anyone other than authorized PPC employees while acting in their official capacities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>COPYRIGHT AND TRADEMARKS</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>I. All literary works at&nbsp;<strong>Precious Pages Your eBookstore</strong>&nbsp;are exclusive property of the publisher or its licensors and is protected by copyright and other intellectual property laws. The downloading of any these literary works is intended for the users&#39; personal and non-commercial use. Any other use of literary works downloaded from this service is strictly prohibited. You may not modify, transmit, publish, participate in the transfer or sale of, reproduce, create derivative works from, distribute, perform, display, or in any way exploit, any of the content of these literary works, in whole or in part, without the written consent or permission of PPC.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<strong>DISCLAIMER OF WARRANTY/ LIMITATION OF LIABILITY.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>J. PPC does not warrant, endorse, guarantee, or assume responsibility for any product or service advertised or offered by a third party or any hyperlinked website or service, or featured in any banner or other advertising, and PPC will not be a party to or in any way monitor any transaction between you and third party providers of products or services. PPC has no control over, and assumes no responsibility for, the content, privacy policies, practices or services of any third party websites. If you access a third party website from this service, you do so at your own risk, and you understand that this Agreement does not apply to your use of such websites and services. PPC is relieved from any liability arising from