(2, 0, 4, 'about-us', 'About Us', 'About Us', '<section id=\"ij0e\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\"><div id=\"ioep\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"container\"><h2 id=\"ii8k\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\">Who We Are\r\n	</h2><p id=\"iee8\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\" spellcheck=\"false\" class=\"cke_editable cke_editable_inline cke_contents_ltr cke_show_borders\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#333333\">Romance has a home. It&rsquo;s called&nbsp;<strong>Precious Pages Bookstore</strong>, and it&rsquo;s all about us. If you are a sucker for romance, you&rsquo;ll be at home with us.&nbsp;<strong>eBooklat</strong>&nbsp;is a digital platform that offers to readers all over the world the best digital Tagalog romance novel experience. We give you stories that make you feel the real essence of romance&mdash;and love. But then we are also more than romance. Watch for our alternative stories and novels via the digital distribution of special editions from these publishers: Red Line Media Publishing, Inc. (Red Room), LIB Creatives, (Bookware Publishing, Inc. (My Special Valentine), Lampara Publishing House, Inc. + World&rsquo;s Bestsellers (Filipino translations of the world&rsquo;s current bestsellers and classics.) To date, we have more than 10,000 active users, mostly from abroad&mdash;and the number is growing. With us, you can access our eBooks in ePub format, on either Apple or Android device, at an affordable price. Download the app reader now!</span></span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<span style=\"background-color:white\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333333\">eBooklat</span></strong><span style=\"color:#333333\">&nbsp;is owned and operated by&nbsp;<strong>Precious Pages Corporation.</strong>&nbsp;</span></span><strong> </strong></p><!--p id=\"i8t8\" data-gjs-type=\"paragraph\" draggable=\"true\" data-highlightable=\"1\" class=\"nobottommargin gjs-selected\">\"Sed ut perspiciatis unde o